sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant First as Caller A
    participant Second as Caller B
    participant Service as Service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    First->>+Service: read the row
    Service->>+DB: select
    DB-->>-Service: the row, version 7
    Service-->>-First: the row, version 7
    Second->>+Service: read the row
    Service->>+DB: select
    DB-->>-Service: the row, version 7
    Service-->>-Second: the row, version 7
    First->>+Service: save, with version 7
    Service->>+DB: update where version is 7
    DB-->>-Service: one row, version 8
    Service-->>-First: saved, version 8
    Second->>+Service: save, with version 7
    Service->>+DB: update where version is 7
    DB-->>-Service: no row
    Service-->>-Second: concurrent change: read again
